  "full_source_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Attuning Dust Of Vitality &middot; Vanguard Archive</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/style.css?v=abfe2bac66\">\n\n\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\">\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/site.webmanifest\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#c9a227\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header class=\"site\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\">\n      <span class=\"brand-main\">Vanguard</span><span class=\"brand-sub\">Saga of Heroes Archive</span>\n    </a>\n    <form class=\"quick\" action=\"/items\" method=\"get\" role=\"search\">\n      <input type=\"search\" name=\"q\" maxlength=\"100\" placeholder=\"Search items&hellip;\"\n             value=\"\" aria-label=\"Search items\">\n      <button type=\"submit\">Search</button>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n  <nav class=\"wrap main-nav\">\n    <a href=\"/items\">Items</a>\n    <a href=\"/quests\">Quests</a>\n    <a href=\"/mobs\">Creatures</a>\n    <a href=\"/classes\">Classes</a>\n    <a href=\"/abilities\">Abilities</a>\n    <a href=\"/zones\">Zones</a>\n    <a href=\"/diplomacy\">Diplomacy</a>\n    <a href=\"/crafting\">Crafting</a>\n    <a href=\"/gameplay\">Gameplay</a>\n    <a href=\"/guides\">Guides</a>\n    <a href=\"/vgoemulator\">Play</a>\n  </nav>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"detail-head\">\n  <h1 class=\"tier-mundane\">Attuning Dust Of Vitality</h1>\n  <p class=\"muted\">\n    Item Level 5\n    &middot; <span class=\"tier-mundane\">Mundane</span>\n    &middot; Misc\n    \n  </p>\n</div>\n\n\n  <div class=\"tooltip-shot\">\n    <div class=\"tooltip-pair\">\n      \n        <figure>\n          <figcaption class=\"cap\">Photographed in game</figcaption>\n          <img src=\"/static/items/manual-attuning-dust-of-vitality.png?v=1790832962\"\n               alt=\"In-game tooltip for Attuning Dust Of Vitality\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </figure>\n      \n      \n        <figure>\n          <figcaption class=\"cap\">Rebuilt from the archive</figcaption>\n          <span class=\"tt tt-open\" role=\"note\"><img class=\"tt-icon\" src=\"/static/vgoicons/20143.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <span class=\"tt-fields\">\n      <span class=\"tt-line name tier-mundane\">Attuning Dust Of Vitality</span>\n      <span class=\"tt-line soulbound\">No Sell</span>\n      <span class=\"tt-line type\">Misc</span>\n      <span class=\"tt-line plain\">Item Level: 5</span>\n      <span class=\"tt-line plain\">Required Class:</span>\n      <span class=\"tt-line classes\">Bard, Paladin, Cleric, Druid, Inquisitor, Psionicist, Monk, Ranger, Dread Knight, Rogue, Shaman, Sorcerer, Disciple, Warrior, Blood Mage, Necromancer, Berserker</span>\n      <span class=\"tt-line muted\">This item cannot be deconstructed.</span>\n    </span>\n  </span>\n        </figure>\n      \n    </div>\n    <p class=\"muted\">\n      \n      The tooltip on the left is a photograph a player took while the game\n      was running &mdash; the primary record, and for many items the only\n      one. The panel on the right is the same tooltip rebuilt from the\n      fields this archive holds; nothing in it is copied from the picture.\n      Where the two disagree, the photograph is the older evidence.\n      \n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n\n<div class=\"cols\">\n  <div>\n    <h2>Properties</h2>\n    <dl class=\"kv\">\n      \n        <div><dt>Item level</dt><dd>5</dd></div>\n      \n        <div><dt>Rarity</dt><dd><a class=\"tier-mundane\"\n          href=\"/items?tier=8\">Mundane</a></dd></div>\n      \n        <div><dt>Type</dt><dd><a href=\"/items?type=40\">Misc</a></dd></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n        <div><dt>Zone</dt><dd><a href=\"/items?zone=55\">Brennan&#39;s Stead</a></dd></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n        <div><dt>Also</dt><dd>No Sell, Cannot be deconstructed</dd></div>\n    </dl>\n\n    \n      <h2>Usable by</h2>\n      <p>\n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=2\">Bard</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=46\">Berserker</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=44\">Blood Mage</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=5\">Cleric</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=27\">Disciple</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=20\">Dread Knight</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=7\">Druid</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=10\">Inquisitor</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=15\">Monk</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=45\">Necromancer</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=4\">Paladin</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=14\">Psionicist</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=19\">Ranger</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=21\">Rogue</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=22\">Shaman</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=25\">Sorcerer</a>\n      \n        <a class=\"pill\" href=\"/items?class=28\">Warrior</a>\n      </p>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div>\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <h2>Description</h2>\n      <p>A pile of attuning dust used to bring out the properties of resources when they are being refined. Also adds energy when used alone or with some resonating dusts. Enhancement: Vitality. Enhances: Ore, Slabs, Timber, Bales</p>\n    \n\n    \n      <h2>Dropped by</h2>\n      <div class=\"scroll\">\n      <table>\n        <thead><tr><th>Creature</th><th>Level</th><th>Zone</th><th>Drop rate</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n        \n          <tr>\n            <td><a href=\"/mobs/justalon-trueheart\">Justalon Trueheart</a></td>\n            <td class=\"num\">1</td>\n            <td class=\"muted\">Leth Nurae</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">\n              50.0%\n              <span class=\"muted\">(1/2)</span>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n          <tr>\n            <td><a href=\"/mobs/thano-ithera\">Thano Ithera</a></td>\n            <td class=\"num\">12</td>\n            <td class=\"muted\">Lomshir</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">\n              35.7%\n              <span class=\"muted\">(5/14)</span>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n          <tr>\n            <td><a href=\"/mobs/treasure-chest\">Treasure Chest</a></td>\n            <td class=\"num\">1</td>\n            <td class=\"muted\">Ruins of Vol Tuniel</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">\n              0.7%\n              <span class=\"muted\">(14/1970)</span>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n          <tr>\n            <td><a href=\"/mobs/deposit-of-slate\">Deposit of Slate</a></td>\n            <td class=\"num\">1</td>\n            <td class=\"muted\">Shoreline Ruins</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">\n              \n              \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n          <tr>\n            <td><a href=\"/mobs/field-thadger-pup\">Field Thadger Pup</a></td>\n            <td class=\"num\">1</td>\n            <td class=\"muted\">Brennan&#39;s Stead</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">\n              \n              \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      </div>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <h2>Used in recipes</h2>\n  <ul class=\"plain\">\n    \n      <li><a href=\"/crafting/recipes/barbed-board\">Barbed Board</a>\n        <span class=\"muted\">as enhancement</span></li>\n    \n      <li><a href=\"/crafting/recipes/basalt-block\">Basalt Block</a>\n        <span class=\"muted\">as enhancement</span></li>\n    \n      <li><a href=\"/crafting/recipes/slate-block\">Slate Block</a>\n        <span class=\"muted\">as enhancement</span></li>\n    \n      <li><a href=\"/crafting/recipes/weakened-board\">Weakened Board</a>\n        <span class=\"muted\">as enhancement</span></li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:30px\">Sources</h2>\n  \n    <p>\n      The stats above were read from <a href=\"https://www.vgoemulator.net/archive/MMODB%20Vanguard/vg.mmodb.com/items/attuning-dust-of-vitality-16.html\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">VGOEmulator&#39;s MMODB mirror</a>.\n    </p>\n  \n\n  \n    <h3>Where another source disagrees</h3>\n    <div class=\"scroll\">\n      <table class=\"listing compact\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>Field</th><th>Here</th><th>There</th><th>Said by</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          \n            <tr>\n              <td>description</td><td title=\"Attunes Vitality. Used on Ore, Slabs, Timber, Bales.\">Attunes Vitality. Used on Ore, Slabs, Timber, Bales.</td>\n              <td title=\"A pile of attuning dust used to bring out the properties of resources when they are being refined. Also adds energy when used alone or with some resonating dusts. Enhancement: Vitality. Enhances: Ore, Slabs, Timber, Bales\">A pile of attuning dust used to bring out the properties of resources when they are bei...</td>\n              <td>a tooltip photographed in game</td>\n            </tr>\n          \n            <tr>\n              <td>item level</td><td title=\"5\">5</td>\n              <td title=\"0\">0</td>\n              <td><a href=\"https://vgoplayers.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">VGOPlayers</a></td>\n            </tr>\n          \n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <p class=\"muted small\">Neither reading is presented as the correction of the other. We hold\n      the name of whoever recorded the other value but not the page it was\n      on, so these link to the site rather than to the record.\n    </p>\n  \n\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:26px\"><a href=\"/items\">&larr; Back to items</a></p>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"wrap site-footer\">\n  <p>\n    75,066 items &middot;\n    4,776 quests &middot;\n    15,418 creatures &middot;\n    18,050 loot entries &middot;\n    401 zones\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"muted\">\n    A preservation archive of fan documentation for <em>Vanguard: Saga of Heroes</em>,\n    which closed in 2014. Nothing here is our own work &mdash; it was written by\n    the community over many years and is reproduced so it does not disappear.\n  </p>\n  \n  <p class=\"muted credits\">\n    With thanks to\n    <a href=\"https://vgoplayers.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">VGOPlayers</a>,\n    Vanguard Item Database,\n    <a href=\"https://www.vgoemulator.net/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">the VGO Emulator team</a>,\n    <a href=\"http://thetelonproject.wikidot.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">The Telon Project</a>,\n    The Steel Warrior,\n    Vanguard Crafters,\n    MMODB,\n    Curse,\n    <a href=\"http://wiki.silkyvenom.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">Silky Venom</a>,\n    the IGN Vanguard Vault,\n    Monkly Business,\n    <a href=\"https://vanguard.gamepressure.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">gamepressure</a>,\n    Vanguard Shaman,\n    DungeonGuru,\n    <a href=\"https://www.tentonhammer.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">Ten Ton Hammer</a>,\n    Vanguard Fighters,\n    Lost Company,\n    the Station forums,\n    <a href=\"https://vanguard.fandom.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">the Vanguard Wiki</a>,\n    The Safe House,\n    VG Rangers,\n    Xanadu,\n    Vanguard Guide,\n    VG Walkthroughs,\n    Vanguard Spheres,\n    Gonzwerks,\n    vgtact,\n    Covenant of the Phoenix,\n    Aradrin,\n    Angry Goblins\n    and ZAM.\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"muted\">\n    \n    \n    Built 2026-10-10.\n  </p>\n</footer>\n<script type=\"